@api_url = http://localhost:5100/api

########## /api/knights - Knight queries ##########

### Get all knights
GET {{api_url}}/knights

### Get knight by name - Seiya
GET {{api_url}}/knights/Seiya

### Get knight by name - Hyoga
GET {{api_url}}/knights/Hyoga

### Get knight by name - Shaka
GET {{api_url}}/knights/Shaka

########## /api/recommendations/knight - Knight recommendation ##########

### Recommend knight for ice threat in Acuario
POST {{api_url}}/recommendations/knight
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enemyType": "ice",
  "location": "Acuario",
  "urgency": "high",
  "availableKnights": ["Seiya", "Shiryu", "Hyoga", "Shun", "Ikki"]
}

### Recommend knight for fire threat in Leo
POST {{api_url}}/recommendations/knight
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enemyType": "fire",
  "location": "Leo",
  "urgency": "critical",
  "availableKnights": ["Seiya", "Shiryu", "Hyoga"]
}

########## /api/threats/classify - Threat classification ##########

### Classify ice threat near Acuario
POST {{api_url}}/threats/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "High cosmic energy of ice type detected near the house of Acuario. Multiple frost anomalies reported.",
  "location": "Acuario",
  "damageType": "ice"
}

### Classify cosmic threat near Leo
POST {{api_url}}/threats/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "A divine-level energy surge has been detected approaching the house of Leo. The cosmos signature does not match any known knight.",
  "location": "Leo"
}

########## /api/battles/simulate - Battle simulation ##########

### Simulate battle Seiya vs Ikki
POST {{api_url}}/battles/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fighterA": "Seiya",
  "fighterB": "Ikki",
  "scenario": "Sanctuary",
  "constraints": {
    "noDivineArmor": true,
    "fatigueLevel": "medium"
  }
}

### Simulate battle Hyoga vs Milo
POST {{api_url}}/battles/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fighterA": "Hyoga",
  "fighterB": "Milo",
  "scenario": "Scorpio House",
  "constraints": {
    "noDivineArmor": false,
    "fatigueLevel": "none"
  }
}

########## /api/missions/generate - Mission generation ##########

### Generate mission to protect Sagitario
POST {{api_url}}/missions/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objective": "Protect the passage to Athena's chamber in the house of Sagitario",
  "location": "Sagitario",
  "assignedKnights": ["Seiya", "Shiryu", "Shun"],
  "threatLevel": "gold"
}

### Generate mission for reconnaissance
POST {{api_url}}/missions/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objective": "Reconnaissance mission to identify the source of dark cosmos near the Star Hill",
  "location": "Star Hill",
  "assignedKnights": ["Mu", "Shaka"],
  "threatLevel": "divine"
}

########## /api/cosmos/evaluate - Cosmos evaluation ##########

### Evaluate cosmos of Shiryu after battle
POST {{api_url}}/cosmos/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knightName": "Shiryu",
  "context": "after a long battle against a Gold Knight"
}

### Evaluate cosmos of Seiya at peak
POST {{api_url}}/cosmos/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "knightName": "Seiya",
  "context": "during the final confrontation at the Sanctuary"
}
